The '''Furniture Catalogue''' can be purchased at the [[Carpenter's Shop]] for {{Price|200000}}, after upgrading the [[farmhouse]]. It can also be purchased from [[Robin]]'s shop at the [[Desert Festival]] for {{Price|1000|Calico}}.

Once placed, [[File:Right-Click.png|24px]] on the furniture catalogue allows the player to purchase many [[furniture]] items for {{Price|0}} in unlimited quantity.

The furniture catalogue is similar to the [[Catalogue]] sold at [[Pierre's General Store]], which gives access to [[wallpaper]] and [[flooring]].

The furniture catalogue can also be used as a display table. Selecting an inventory item and [[File:Right-Click.png|24px]] on the catalogue will place the item on the middle of the catalogue.

'''Tip:''' {{Key|Shift}} + [[File:Left-Click.png|24px]] on an item in the [[Catalogue]] or Furniture Catalogue to add it directly to inventory, instead of attaching it to the mouse cursor.

